  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<center>\n<!-- Internal_head_07-11-2024 -->\n\n</center>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3a6be1b8 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;height: 225px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 36px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 36px;border-style: none\">\n<h1><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>IIT GATE 2027 Exam Apply Online Form | Information Brochure and More</strong></span></h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 35px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 35px;border-style: none\">02 September 2026 | 07:27 PM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 154px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 154px;border-style: none;vertical-align: middle\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Indian Institute of Technology IIT Madras has released the Information Brochure for Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering GATE 2027. Various Institute are participating in GATE 2027. Those Candidates Are Interested in GATE 2027 Exam Can Apply Online from <strong>27/08/2026 to 27/09/2026</strong>. candidates should read the information brochure for all the information related to the Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering Exam like syllabus, eligibility, Question Paper, age limit, Score Card, fees, GATE 2027 information and other types of information and then apply.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<center>\n<!-- SR26042026_Square -->\n\n</center>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111646.png\">\n        <span>Telegram</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariResult2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box whatsapp\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733585.png\">\n        <span>WhatsApp</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5IElwBlHpVBd6i5a18\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box instagram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png\">\n        <span>Instagram</span>\n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box twitter\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5968/5968958.png\">\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;height: 1766px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 248px\">\n<td style=\"width: 102.361%;height: 248px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Graduate Aptitude Test in Engineering (GATE 2027)</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Conducted By : Indian Institute of Technology IIT Madras</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>IIT GATE 2027 Online Form : Short Details of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 148px\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.3151%;height: 148px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<strong> 27/08/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online Phase I : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>27/09/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online Phase II<strong> (Extended Period)</strong> : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>05/10/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>GATE 2027 Recertificate Date <strong>: 14-21 October 2026</strong></li>\n<li>Exam Date :<strong> 06-21 February 2027<br>\n</strong></li>\n<li>Exam City Available<strong> : 04/01/2027</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available :<strong> Before Exam</strong></li>\n<li>Answer Key Available :<strong> Notified Soon</strong></li>\n<li>Result Declared : <strong>19/03/2027</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.0459%;height: 148px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>2000/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <b>1000/-</b></li>\n<li>All Category Female : <b>1000/-</b></li>\n<li><strong>Phase II with Late Fees:</strong></li>\n<li>General / OBC / EWS : <b>2500/-</b></li>\n<li>SC / ST / PH : <b>1500/-</b></li>\n<li>All Category Female : <b>1500/-</b></li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Online Fee Mode Only.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 155px\">\n<td style=\"width: 102.361%;height: 155px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>IIT GATE Online Form 2027: </b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Age Limit Details</b></span></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum Age : <b>No Limit</b></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <b>No Limit</b></li>\n<li>There is NO age limit to appear for GATE 2027.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 102.361%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>IIT GATE 2027 Exam : Eligibility Details</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 30.3214%\" colspan=\"3\"><strong>Exam Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 25px;width: 72.0396%\" colspan=\"7\"><strong>IIT GATE Eligibility 2027</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 90px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 30.3214%;height: 90px\" colspan=\"3\">IIT GATE 2027</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 72.0396%;height: 90px\" colspan=\"7\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\">Passed / Appearing Pharma D (10+2) / MBBS / B.Sc / BA / B.Com / B.E / B.Tech / B.Pharm / B.Arch / B.Sc. Research / B.S. M.Sc. / MA / MCA / M.E. / M.Tech / Dual Degree / Integrated Courses</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\"><a title=\"GATE 2027 Eligibility Details\" href=\"https://gate2027.iitm.ac.in/eligibility_criteria\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">For Complete Eligibility Details</a></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 376px\">\n<td style=\"width: 102.361%;height: 319px\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Indian Institute of Technology IIT Madras Are Issued Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the GATE 2027 Candidate Can Apply Online for <b><strong>27/08/2026 </strong>to 27/09/2026 (without Late Fee).</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the IIT GATE 2027 Application Form in Sarkari Result Admission Section.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 102.361%;height: 35px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px\">\n<td style=\"width: 102.361%;height: 146px\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.3151%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.0459%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 102.361%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Apply Online</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"GATE 2027 online Form\" href=\"https://goaps.iitm.ac.in/login\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.3151%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>GATE Apply Date Reschedule</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.0459%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://gate2027.iitm.ac.in/important_dates\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.3151%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download GATE 2027 Information Brochure</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.0459%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"GATE 2027\" href=\"https://gate2027.iitm.ac.in/static/doc/IB/GATE2027-IB_v1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.3151%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008080\"><b>Signature Resizer, PDF Compress, Age Calculator and More Tools</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.0459%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.3151%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.0459%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 47.3151%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Official Website</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.0459%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"GATE Official Website\" href=\"https://gate2027.iitm.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GATE 2027 Official Website</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n\n<!-- Internal_header_07-11-2024 -->\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q1. When did the IIT GATE Online Application Process Start?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"743\">27 August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q2.</strong><strong>What is the Exam Date of IIT GATE 2027?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\"><b>GATE 2027 Exam Schedule on 06-21 February 2027</b>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q3. Where can I find the Syllabus for the IIT GATE Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed Subject Wise GATE 2027 Syllabus are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q4. How can I download the IIT GATE 2027 Information Brochure PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q5. What is the last date to apply online for IIT GATE 2027 Information Brochure?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>27 September 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q6. What is the last date to pay the application fee?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Last Date : <strong>27/09/2026</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q7. How can I apply for IIT GATE 2027 Online Form ?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on\n<figure id=\"attachment_27100\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-27100\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-27100\" title=\"IIT GATE 2027 Online Form Sarkari Result\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/iitgate2027-scaled.png\" alt=\"IIT GATE 2027 Online Form\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1465\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/iitgate2027-scaled.png 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/iitgate2027-300x172.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/iitgate2027-1024x586.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/iitgate2027-768x439.png 768w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/iitgate2027-1536x879.png 1536w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/iitgate2027-2048x1172.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-27100\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">IIT GATE 2027 Online Form SarkariResult.Com</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\"><strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong></strong></p></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Main Pajes 2 -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
